      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "🔵 Blue → Frontend\n🟢 Green → Backend Services\n🟣 Purple → AI / RAG Layer\n🟠 Orange → Data Layer\n⚫ Grey → Infrastructure",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "🔵 Blue → Frontend\n🟢 Green → Backend Services\n🟣 Purple → AI / RAG Layer\n🟠 Orange → Data Layer\n⚫ Grey → Infrastructure",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "-4XF8886dgifHODcokUtF",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -116.94339567324846,
      "y": -353.04543754680424,
      "width": 1102.8799965730027,
      "height": 103.62564168042364,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b29",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 56069385,
      "version": 215,
      "versionNonce": 175808137,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1777149552650,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "This is my end-to-end AI system architecture. The user interacts with a React\nfrontend, which communicates with a FastAPI-based API gateway. The system is\ndivided into ingestion and query pipelines.",
      "fontSize": 27.633504448112973,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "This is my end-to-end AI system architecture. The user interacts with a React frontend, which communicates with a FastAPI-based API gateway. The system is divided into ingestion and query pipelines.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "_X2BGF5wQ9wrmfSLYDeCB",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -80.05269253424655,
      "y": -169.9734705780558,
      "width": 1029.098590294999,
      "height": 69.08376112028243,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2A",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 695886855,
      "version": 215,
      "versionNonce": 815261033,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1777149552650,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Uploaded PDFs go through processing, chunking, and embedding before being\nstored in a vector database.",
      "fontSize": 27.633504448112973,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Uploaded PDFs go through processing, chunking, and embedding before being stored in a vector database.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "8x5qc3uihvsmmycBr9fiy",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -98.05587683019536,
      "y": -38.71432444951921,
      "width": 1065.1049588868966,
      "height": 69.08376112028243,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2B",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 215155689,
      "version": 215,
      "versionNonce": 1965641801,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1777149552650,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "For queries, we embed the user input, retrieve relevant context, and pass it to\nan LLM using prompt engineering.",
      "fontSize": 27.633504448112973,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "For queries, we embed the user input, retrieve relevant context, and pass it to an LLM using prompt engineering.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "yhG2lDwh3F7XBuYB8apzj",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -77.3446209046383,
      "y": 92.54482167901745,
      "width": 1023.6824470357825,
      "height": 69.08376112028243,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2C",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 549341991,
      "version": 215,
      "versionNonce": 1040867113,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1777149552650,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The output is structured, validated through guardrails, and evaluated using\nRAGAS for quality metrics.",
      "fontSize": 27.633504448112973,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The output is structured, validated through guardrails, and evaluated using RAGAS for quality metrics.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
