      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1777149552650,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "I also included caching, logging, and an event-driven queue to make the system\nscalable and production-ready.”",
      "fontSize": 27.633504448112966,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "I also included caching, logging, and an event-driven queue to make the system scalable and production-ready.”",
